<section class="section" id="listings"><div class="card"><div class="cardHead"><div class="cardTitle"><h3><%= isCompanyDashboard ? (companyServiceProfile.primaryLabel || 'Company') + ' public listings' : 'Listings & inventory' %></h3><p><%= isCompanyDashboard ? (companySupportsHotel ? 'A listing is the customer-facing stay page. Create the physical property, room types, room units, and room-night availability under Properties, Rooms & Inventory.' : companySupportsBus ? 'A listing is the customer-facing bus service. Routes, vehicles, live seat maps, and departures select this listing; they are not separate marketplace products.' : 'A listing is the customer-facing service record. Operational inventory selects it rather than retyping the service name.') : 'Bus routes, seat maps, stay rooms, inventory, and price rules.' %></p></div><button class="btn btnBlue" data-modal="create" data-type="listing"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> <%= companySupportsHotel ? 'Create stay listing' : companySupportsBus ? 'Create bus listing' : 'Create listing' %></button></div><div class="innerTabs" data-tab-group="inventory"><button type="button" class="tabBtn is-on" data-tab-target="inventory-all"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> <%= isCompanyDashboard ? (companyServiceProfile.primaryLabel || 'Service') + ' inventory' : 'All inventory' %></button><% if(!isCompanyDashboard || companySupportsBusOperations){ %><button type="button" class="tabBtn" data-tab-target="inventory-routes"><i class="fa-solid fa-bus"></i> Routes & seats</button><% } %><% if(!isCompanyDashboard || companySupportsHotel){ %><button type="button" class="tabBtn" data-tab-target="inventory-stays"><i class="fa-solid fa-hotel"></i> Stays & rooms</button><% } %><button type="button" class="tabBtn" data-tab-target="inventory-pricing"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags"></i> Price rules</button><button type="button" class="tabBtn" data-tab-target="inventory-review"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Needs review</button></div><div class="tabPane is-open" id="inventory-all"><div class="tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Listing</th><th>Type</th><th>Partner</th><th>Inventory</th><th>Country route</th><th>Badge</th><th>Price from</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="listingsTable"></tbody></table></div></div><% if(!isCompanyDashboard || companySupportsBusOperations){ %><div class="tabPane" id="inventory-routes"><div class="tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Route</th><th>Vehicle</th><th>Partner</th><th>Seats</th><th>Schedule</th><th>Status</th><th>Price</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="routeInventoryTable"></tbody></table></div></div><% } %><% if(!isCompanyDashboard || companySupportsHotel){ %><div class="tabPane" id="inventory-stays"><div class="tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Room type</th><th>Partner</th><th>Rooms</th><th>City</th><th>Status</th><th>Price</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="stayInventoryTable"></tbody></table></div></div><% } %><div class="tabPane" id="inventory-pricing"><% if(isCompanyDashboard){ const companyPricingHref = companySupportsBus ? '/company/fares' : companySupportsHotel ? '/company/hotel-rooms' : '/company/listings'; const companyPricingLabel = companySupportsBus ? 'Manage stop-to-stop fares' : companySupportsHotel ? 'Manage room and rate pricing' : 'Manage listing prices'; %><div class="cardHead"><div class="cardTitle"><h3>Service pricing</h3><p>Pricing is controlled by your real service inventory. Use fare products and segment prices for buses, rate plans and room-night prices for stays, or listing inventory prices for the other marketplace services.</p></div><a class="btn btnBlue" href="<%= companyPricingHref %>"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags"></i> <%= companyPricingLabel %></a></div><div class="splitGrid"><div class="splitItem"><div class="splitTop"><span>Currency</span><span class="badge ok"><%= dashboardData?.company?.currency || dashboardData?.companyDetail?.currency || platformConfig?.defaultCurrency || '—' %></span></div><p>The company currency remains authoritative through listing, checkout, payment, receipt, and settlement.</p></div><div class="splitItem"><div class="splitTop"><span>Public price</span><span class="badge info">Database controlled</span></div><p>Customer cards and checkout totals read the current active inventory price; no dashboard placeholder price is used.</p></div></div><% } else { const pricingRules = Array.isArray(dashboardData?.priceRules) ? dashboardData.priceRules : []; %><div class="cardHead"><div class="cardTitle"><h3>Platform pricing rules</h3><p>Only active rules stored in MongoDB are shown and applied. Each row can be opened, exported, or edited without losing its listing scope and date window.</p></div><button class="btn btnBlue" type="button" data-modal="create" data-type="price rule"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add price rule</button></div><% if(pricingRules.length){ %><div class="tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Scope</th><th>Value</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="priceRulesTable"></tbody></table></div><% } else { %><div class="emptyState"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags"></i><strong>No platform pricing rules configured</strong><span>Base listing and inventory prices remain authoritative until an administrator creates a real adjustment rule.</span></div><% } %><% } %></div><div class="tabPane" id="inventory-review"><div class="tableWrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Partner</th><th>Reason</th><th>Risk</th><th>Submitted</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="reviewInventoryTable"></tbody></table></div></div></div></section>
